         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span>D</span>iv geru<span>o</span>che mine ſinne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5" id="v5" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5" tabindex="-1">v5</a>
