         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span>v</span> mine bruſt erreinen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v6" id="v6" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v6" tabindex="-1">v6</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6
