         </span><span>U</span>on aller ſlahte mainen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v7" id="v7" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v7" tabindex="-1">v7</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span>D</span>az ich nu mv<span>e</span>zze ſchr<span class="del">e</span>iben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v8" id="v8" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v8" tabindex="-1">v8</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v8
