         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v10
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span>D</span>az der to<span>e</span>t waz bechomen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v11" id="v11" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v11" tabindex="-1">v11</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v11
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span>U</span>on dem ærſten wibe in die welt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v12" id="v12" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v12" tabindex="-1">v12</a>
