         </span><span>L</span>ieht v den æwigen leip<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v15" id="v15" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v15" tabindex="-1">v15</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v15
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span>m</span>it ziêrde mu<span>e</span>zze ſchowen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v16" id="v16" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v16" tabindex="-1">v16</a>
