         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v18
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span>S</span>i gebar die scho<span>e</span>nen ſvnne <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v18" id="v18" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v18" tabindex="-1">v18</a>
