         </span><span>I</span>r chevſche lævhtet vber al<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v23" id="v23" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v23" tabindex="-1">v23</a>
