         </span><span>N</span>v ſul wir ir getrowen <span class="del">wol</span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v24" id="v24" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v24" tabindex="-1">v24</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v25
