         </span><span>M</span>it den gotes worten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v35" id="v35" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v35" tabindex="-1">v35</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v36
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span>I</span>r wart div warheit geſagt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v36" id="v36" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v36" tabindex="-1">v36</a>
