         </span><span>S</span>i iſt mu<span>o</span>ter v magt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v37" id="v37" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v37" tabindex="-1">v37</a>
