         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v41
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span>D</span>ie nie mannes geluſt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v41" id="v41" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v41" tabindex="-1">v41</a>
