         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v42
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span>G</span>ewan noch der ſvnden val<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v42" id="v42" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v42" tabindex="-1">v42</a>
