         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v43
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span>S</span>i ist mu<span>o</span>ter ane mal<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v43" id="v43" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v43" tabindex="-1">v43</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v44
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>10r Von æwen ze æwen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v44" id="v44" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v44" tabindex="-1">v44</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v45
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Wir ſulen ſey an ru<span>e</span>fen v flêgen <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v45" id="v45" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v45" tabindex="-1">v45</a>
