         </span><span>H</span>Imeliſche vrowe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v46" id="v46" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v46" tabindex="-1">v46</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v47
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit geiſtlichem to<span>v</span>we<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v47" id="v47" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v47" tabindex="-1">v47</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v48
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>begivz minen gedanch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v48" id="v48" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v48" tabindex="-1">v48</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v49
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ich din lob vnt dinen ſanch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v49" id="v49" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v49" tabindex="-1">v49</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v50
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ein teil gemæren mv<span>u</span>zze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v50" id="v50" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v50" tabindex="-1">v50</a>
