         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v51
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span>v</span> hilf daz ich gebu<span>e</span>zze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v51" id="v51" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v51" tabindex="-1">v51</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v52
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz vnreht daz ich ie begie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v52" id="v52" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v52" tabindex="-1">v52</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v53
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wan ich gezweivelt nie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v53" id="v53" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v53" tabindex="-1">v53</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v54
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an dir noch an dem ſune dein<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
