         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v58
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz dv nie vliezze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v57" id="v57" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v57" tabindex="-1">v57</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v59
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den heinen yrdiſch man<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v58" id="v58" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v58" tabindex="-1">v58</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v60
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der dich ze votinne wolde han<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v59" id="v59" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v59" tabindex="-1">v59</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v61
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span>D</span>v biſt lieht dan der tak<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v60" id="v60" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v60" tabindex="-1">v60</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v62
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>v aller tugende ſmak<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v61" id="v61" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v61" tabindex="-1">v61</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v63
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>flivzzet ovz diner ſcho<span>e</span>zzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v62" id="v62" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v62" tabindex="-1">v62</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v64
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>bedenche die êre grozzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v63" id="v63" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v63" tabindex="-1">v63</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v65
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die dir der engel brahte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v64" id="v64" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v64" tabindex="-1">v64</a>
