         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v496
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die trehen von den augen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v395" id="v395" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v395" tabindex="-1">v395</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v497
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ez douht 15r in ein michel ſchande<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v396" id="v396" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v396" tabindex="-1">v396</a>
