         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v641
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>fur aller ſlahte chumm<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v488" id="v488" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v488" tabindex="-1">v488</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v642
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dv ſtifteſt michel wund<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v489" id="v489" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v489" tabindex="-1">v489</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v643
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dvrch daz dv im allem ob<span class="del">e</span> piſt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v490" id="v490" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v490" tabindex="-1">v490</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v644
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>din ſchepfede dv gibeſt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v491" id="v491" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v491" tabindex="-1">v491</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v645
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>maneg hande wunne <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v492" id="v492" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v492" tabindex="-1">v492</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v646
