         </span>von regen v ouch von ſunne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v493" id="v493" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v493" tabindex="-1">v493</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v647
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>macheſt dv die erde behaft<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v494" id="v494" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v494" tabindex="-1">v494</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v648
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den vogelin geiſt du die chraft<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v495" id="v495" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v495" tabindex="-1">v495</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v649
