         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v693
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſine botſchaft frone<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v532" id="v532" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v532" tabindex="-1">v532</a>
