         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1696
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1187" id="v1187" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1187" tabindex="-1">v1187</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1697
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Al ir gewonheit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1188" id="v1188" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1188" tabindex="-1">v1188</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1698
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſag ich ev bereit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1189" id="v1189" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1189" tabindex="-1">v1189</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1699
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>alle morgen vil fru<span>o</span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1190" id="v1190" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1190" tabindex="-1">v1190</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1700
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſo gedahte ſi dar zv<span>o</span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1191" id="v1191" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1191" tabindex="-1">v1191</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1701
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da ſi ir gebeteſ gu<span>o</span>t<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
