         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1708
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den half ſi vnz an die no<span>e</span>ne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1198" id="v1198" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1198" tabindex="-1">v1198</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1709
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſo gie aber ſchone<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1199" id="v1199" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1199" tabindex="-1">v1199</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1710
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
