         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1836
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gen dem himiliſchen wirt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1271" id="v1271" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1271" tabindex="-1">v1271</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1837
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>d ſei mæhilen solde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1272" id="v1272" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1272" tabindex="-1">v1272</a>
