         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1905
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>waren bevangen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1314" id="v1314" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1314" tabindex="-1">v1314</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1906
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>v ſiech geweſen lang<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1315" id="v1315" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1315" tabindex="-1">v1315</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1907
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſo ſi ſey geru<span>e</span>ert<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1908
