         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1316" id="v1316" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1316" tabindex="-1">v1316</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1909
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>d<span class="del">i</span>v kraft ſey vmbegurt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
