         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1917
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1317" id="v1317" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1317" tabindex="-1">v1317</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1918
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span>N</span>u bite wir die heren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1919
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1318" id="v1318" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1318" tabindex="-1">v1318</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1920
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſwa wir an d ſelen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1319" id="v1319" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1319" tabindex="-1">v1319</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1921
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze tief ſein vwundet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1320" id="v1320" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1320" tabindex="-1">v1320</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1922
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ir ſey daz gekvndet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1321" id="v1321" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1321" tabindex="-1">v1321</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1923
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ſi den geiſt zier<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1322" id="v1322" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1322" tabindex="-1">v1322</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1924
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>v vnſ erledige ſchier<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1323" id="v1323" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1323" tabindex="-1">v1323</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1925
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
