         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1928
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz wir niht ſchiech werden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1327" id="v1327" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1327" tabindex="-1">v1327</a>
