         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1929
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span>D</span>o ſi wachſen begunde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1328" id="v1328" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1328" tabindex="-1">v1328</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1930
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do wart ſi and ſtunde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
