         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1934
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſo ſchone an dem leibe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1330" id="v1330" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1330" tabindex="-1">v1330</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1935
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>verre vor andren weiben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1331" id="v1331" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1331" tabindex="-1">v1331</a>
