         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1938
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er die magt gewunne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1334" id="v1334" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1334" tabindex="-1">v1334</a>
