         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1941
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>d was ein kindiſch man<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1336" id="v1336" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1336" tabindex="-1">v1336</a>
