         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1946
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der wolde ſei ælichen næmen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1339" id="v1339" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1339" tabindex="-1">v1339</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1947
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an alle falſche minne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1340" id="v1340" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1340" tabindex="-1">v1340</a>
