         </span>ſi ſpch daz ſi niht wolde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1343" id="v1343" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1343" tabindex="-1">v1343</a>
