         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1957
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſi wolde weſen ſicher<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1347" id="v1347" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1347" tabindex="-1">v1347</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1958
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vor mannes gebende<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1348" id="v1348" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1348" tabindex="-1">v1348</a>
