         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1964
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1965
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1349" id="v1349" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1349" tabindex="-1">v1349</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1966
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span>E</span>r bot ſchatz grozen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1350" id="v1350" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1350" tabindex="-1">v1350</a>
