         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2749
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ouz layme bilden began<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2750
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1826" id="v1826" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1826" tabindex="-1">v1826</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2751
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der beſchu<span>o</span>f der werlde vmechreiz<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1827" id="v1827" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1827" tabindex="-1">v1827</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2752
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der allev dink wole waiz<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2753
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2754
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1828" id="v1828" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1828" tabindex="-1">v1828</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2755
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wan aller herzen tougen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1829" id="v1829" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1829" tabindex="-1">v1829</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2756
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>blu<span>o</span>ent vor ſinen augen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1830" id="v1830" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1830" tabindex="-1">v1830</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2757
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der laitet des meres vnde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1831" id="v1831" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1831" tabindex="-1">v1831</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2758
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>v daz abgrunde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2759
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2760
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1832" id="v1832" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1832" tabindex="-1">v1832</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2761
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>erde v luft<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1833" id="v1833" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1833" tabindex="-1">v1833</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2762
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>v der helle 34v gruft<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1834" id="v1834" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1834" tabindex="-1">v1834</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2763
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er mit ſinen cho<span>e</span>ren <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1835" id="v1835" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1835" tabindex="-1">v1835</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2764
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>geru<span>o</span>che mich er ho<span>e</span>ren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2765
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1836" id="v1836" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1836" tabindex="-1">v1836</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2766
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wan ich daz vrchunde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1837" id="v1837" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1837" tabindex="-1">v1837</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2767
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von ſein ſelbes munde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1838" id="v1838" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1838" tabindex="-1">v1838</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2768
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von ſeinen genaden nemen wil<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1839" id="v1839" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1839" tabindex="-1">v1839</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2769
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>hie iſt herſchefte vil<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2770
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2771
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1840" id="v1840" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1840" tabindex="-1">v1840</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2772
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die wil ich niht ver zeihen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1841" id="v1841" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1841" tabindex="-1">v1841</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2773
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>got ru<span>o</span>che mir er zaigen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1842" id="v1842" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1842" tabindex="-1">v1842</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2774
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit ſein ſelbeſ veſte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1843" id="v1843" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1843" tabindex="-1">v1843</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2775
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſwaz mir ſei daz beſte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1844" id="v1844" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1844" tabindex="-1">v1844</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2776
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Ich han den heinen willen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1845" id="v1845" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1845" tabindex="-1">v1845</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2777
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>noch nimmer wil gewinnen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2778
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1846" id="v1846" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1846" tabindex="-1">v1846</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2779
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ich mit cheinem maile <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1847" id="v1847" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1847" tabindex="-1">v1847</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2780
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>miner ſele vertaile<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2781
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1848" id="v1848" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1848" tabindex="-1">v1848</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2782
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>meinen magtom ſol ich herten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1849" id="v1849" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1849" tabindex="-1">v1849</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2783
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>doch ſeit ich ab der gerten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1850" id="v1850" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1850" tabindex="-1">v1850</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2784
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die toube ſach fliegen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1851" id="v1851" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1851" tabindex="-1">v1851</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2785
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſo wil ich niht betriegen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1852" id="v1852" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1852" tabindex="-1">v1852</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2786
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz himeliſche zaichen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2787
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1853" id="v1853" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1853" tabindex="-1">v1853</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2788
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>meinen ſin wil ich reichen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1854" id="v1854" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1854" tabindex="-1">v1854</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2789
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in ewer aller rat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1855" id="v1855" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1855" tabindex="-1">v1855</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2790
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſwer mich zehute beſtat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2791
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2792
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1856" id="v1856" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1856" tabindex="-1">v1856</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2793
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>deme wil ich ſein gehorſam <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1857" id="v1857" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1857" tabindex="-1">v1857</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2794
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mineſ leibeſ ich nieman gan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2795
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2796
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2797
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2798
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2799
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1858" id="v1858" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1858" tabindex="-1">v1858</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2800
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>alten noch iungen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1859" id="v1859" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1859" tabindex="-1">v1859</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2801
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze chranker wonunge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1860" id="v1860" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1860" tabindex="-1">v1860</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2802
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze ſundegen ſachen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1861" id="v1861" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1861" tabindex="-1">v1861</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2803
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz kan nieman gemac<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1862" id="v1862" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1862" tabindex="-1">v1862</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2804
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span>D</span>iſe rede douhte ſev lobelich <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1863" id="v1863" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1863" tabindex="-1">v1863</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2805
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do ſprach mennechlich<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2806
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2807
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2808
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2809
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1864" id="v1864" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1864" tabindex="-1">v1864</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2810
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſi were eben genu<span>o</span>k<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1865" id="v1865" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1865" tabindex="-1">v1865</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2811
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir leip ſi alſo wol tru<span>o</span>ch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1866" id="v1866" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1866" tabindex="-1">v1866</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2812
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ſei die levte diche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1867" id="v1867" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1867" tabindex="-1">v1867</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2813
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>muſten ane blichen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1868" id="v1868" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1868" tabindex="-1">v1868</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2814
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Do hete der alte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1869" id="v1869" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1869" tabindex="-1">v1869</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2815
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>einen mehelſchatz behalten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1870" id="v1870" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1870" tabindex="-1">v1870</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2816
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ein guldein 35r vingerlein <br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2817
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1871" id="v1871" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1871" tabindex="-1">v1871</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2818
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz enpfienk von im daz magedein<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1872" id="v1872" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1872" tabindex="-1">v1872</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2819
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
