         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2916
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſi heten ane erge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1930" id="v1930" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1930" tabindex="-1">v1930</a>
