         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2917
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vil gu<span>o</span>t gevertte <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1931" id="v1931" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1931" tabindex="-1">v1931</a>
