         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2923
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da ſi wonent mit frevden immermere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1934" id="v1934" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1934" tabindex="-1">v1934</a>
