         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2935
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ez waz in ſinem lande<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1943" id="v1943" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1943" tabindex="-1">v1943</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2936
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>boten im do ſande<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1944" id="v1944" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1944" tabindex="-1">v1944</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2937
