         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>noch mohte ſein niht geſparen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1960" id="v1960" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1960" tabindex="-1">v1960</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2961
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>An dem andern morgen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1961" id="v1961" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1961" tabindex="-1">v1961</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2962
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>hu<span>o</span>b er ſich ovz mit ſorgen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1962" id="v1962" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1962" tabindex="-1">v1962</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2963
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der heilige patriarch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1963" id="v1963" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1963" tabindex="-1">v1963</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2964
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er pat die vrowen ſtark<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1964" id="v1964" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1964" tabindex="-1">v1964</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2965
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ſi mariam behu<span>o</span>ten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1965" id="v1965" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1965" tabindex="-1">v1965</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2966
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
