         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2968
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er begunde ſey biten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1967" id="v1967" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1967" tabindex="-1">v1967</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2969
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ſi ſey in die mitten legten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1968" id="v1968" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1968" tabindex="-1">v1968</a>
