         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2970
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>v ir mit fleizze pflegten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1969" id="v1969" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1969" tabindex="-1">v1969</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2971
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſein geſinde hiez er fur ſich gan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1970" id="v1970" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1970" tabindex="-1">v1970</a>
