         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2972
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er gebot daz ſi vndertan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1971" id="v1971" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1971" tabindex="-1">v1971</a>
