         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2981
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ſi ir wolden dienen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1976" id="v1976" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1976" tabindex="-1">v1976</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2982
