         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2999
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>varbe maniger hande<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1988" id="v1988" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1988" tabindex="-1">v1988</a>
