         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3884
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ob ſi vnſ volleiſt geit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2492" id="v2492" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2492" tabindex="-1">v2492</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3885
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>eine rede wil ich praiten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2493" id="v2493" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2493" tabindex="-1">v2493</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3886
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vor aller chriſtenheite<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2494" id="v2494" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2494" tabindex="-1">v2494</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3887
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
