         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3888
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſulen ſey wol behalten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2496" id="v2496" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2496" tabindex="-1">v2496</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3889
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wan ez alſo war iſt <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2497" id="v2497" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2497" tabindex="-1">v2497</a>
