         </span>ze den heinem werltlichem manne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2640" id="v2640" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2640" tabindex="-1">v2640</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4168
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von div oder danne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2641" id="v2641" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2641" tabindex="-1">v2641</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4169
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſi not ſolte lei<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2642" id="v2642" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2642" tabindex="-1">v2642</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4170
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſi mohten an ir leibe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2643" id="v2643" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2643" tabindex="-1">v2643</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
