         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4179
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit dem gotes gewalte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2649" id="v2649" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2649" tabindex="-1">v2649</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4180
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
