         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4181
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>begunde ſevften harte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2651" id="v2651" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2651" tabindex="-1">v2651</a>
