         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4185
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>was troſtes mvgt ir mir geiêhen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2654" id="v2654" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2654" tabindex="-1">v2654</a>
