         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4890
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ſi in der vnmazzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3020" id="v3020" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3020" tabindex="-1">v3020</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4891
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
