         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4892
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die ſi mit grozzen angen <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3022" id="v3022" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3022" tabindex="-1">v3022</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4893
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
