         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4958
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da man die menige an ſchribe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
