         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4962
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ir ovzze belibe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3053" id="v3053" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3053" tabindex="-1">v3053</a>
