         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4970
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der getorſte da widere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3057" id="v3057" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3057" tabindex="-1">v3057</a>
