         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5446
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da div magt ſunden frey<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3360" id="v3360" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3360" tabindex="-1">v3360</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5447
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zaigte den hailant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3361" id="v3361" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3361" tabindex="-1">v3361</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5448
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den alle reiche 54v v alle lant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3362" id="v3362" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3362" tabindex="-1">v3362</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5449
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ovf genade wellent schowen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3363" id="v3363" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3363" tabindex="-1">v3363</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5450
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ia was ouch bey der vrowen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3364" id="v3364" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3364" tabindex="-1">v3364</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5451
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>weder man noch weip<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3365" id="v3365" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3365" tabindex="-1">v3365</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5452
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>noch den hain yrdiſcher leip<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3366" id="v3366" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3366" tabindex="-1">v3366</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5453
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
