         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5454
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da die engel ſolten dienen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3368" id="v3368" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3368" tabindex="-1">v3368</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
