         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5464
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dan inder geſchreiben ſtæ<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3378" id="v3378" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3378" tabindex="-1">v3378</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5465
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span>D</span>az grozze wu<span>o</span>ffen v chlagen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3379" id="v3379" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3379" tabindex="-1">v3379</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5466
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz andre vrowen muezzen haben haben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3380" id="v3380" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3380" tabindex="-1">v3380</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5467
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſo ſi gewinnent div kint<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3381" id="v3381" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3381" tabindex="-1">v3381</a>
