         </span>daz wenik was ze ſehene<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3413" id="v3413" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3413" tabindex="-1">v3413</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5514
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>v michel ze iehene<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
