         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von wannen daz lieht ſcho<span>e</span>ne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
