         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6152
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die niht gedingen kun<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3793" id="v3793" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3793" tabindex="-1">v3793</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6153
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wider ir veiande<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3794" id="v3794" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3794" tabindex="-1">v3794</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6154
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
