         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6156
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da wolte got ſich ſelben pey<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3797" id="v3797" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3797" tabindex="-1">v3797</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6157
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>lazzen erkennen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
