         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6225
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ez ſei man oder weip<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3839" id="v3839" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3839" tabindex="-1">v3839</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6226
