         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6651
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ein anden 63v wek ſi erkuren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4057" id="v4057" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4057" tabindex="-1">v4057</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6652
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſi wolten ſich behu<span>e</span>ten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4058" id="v4058" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4058" tabindex="-1">v4058</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6653
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ob herodeſ wolte wu<span>e</span>ten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6654
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4059" id="v4059" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4059" tabindex="-1">v4059</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6655
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er mit ſiner ſchande<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4060" id="v4060" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4060" tabindex="-1">v4060</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6656
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir reiſe niht er wande<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4061" id="v4061" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4061" tabindex="-1">v4061</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6657
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſi fu<span>o</span>ren in ir gegene<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4062" id="v4062" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4062" tabindex="-1">v4062</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6658
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>got mit ſinem ſegene<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6659
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
