         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6660
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4063" id="v4063" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4063" tabindex="-1">v4063</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6661
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>braht ſey alle ſant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4064" id="v4064" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4064" tabindex="-1">v4064</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6662
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>haim wider in ir lant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4065" id="v4065" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4065" tabindex="-1">v4065</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6663
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Do geſchach ze perhtnahten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4066" id="v4066" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4066" tabindex="-1">v4066</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6664
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als wir ez kunnen ahten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4067" id="v4067" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4067" tabindex="-1">v4067</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6665
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dannoch zaich me<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4068" id="v4068" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4068" tabindex="-1">v4068</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6666
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do vnſ got die nivwen æ<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4069" id="v4069" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4069" tabindex="-1">v4069</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6667
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
