         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6668
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da wir vnſ inne ſloufen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4071" id="v4071" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4071" tabindex="-1">v4071</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6669
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
