         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6672
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>danne wir komen ſin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4075" id="v4075" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4075" tabindex="-1">v4075</a>
