         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6675
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz wazz ze weine<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4078" id="v4078" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4078" tabindex="-1">v4078</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6676
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
