         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6793
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>v ſine herſchaft<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4152" id="v4152" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4152" tabindex="-1">v4152</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6794
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von aller vnſer kraft<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4153" id="v4153" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4153" tabindex="-1">v4153</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6795
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
