         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in geiſtlichem fiwer<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4158" id="v4158" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4158" tabindex="-1">v4158</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6816
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>v vnſer ſele ze ſtiwer<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4159" id="v4159" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4159" tabindex="-1">v4159</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6817
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſule wir weſen alle<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4160" id="v4160" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4160" tabindex="-1">v4160</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6818
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſam div toube ane galle<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4161" id="v4161" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4161" tabindex="-1">v4161</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6819
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſo wirt vns gegeben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4162" id="v4162" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4162" tabindex="-1">v4162</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6820
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz æwige leben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4163" id="v4163" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4163" tabindex="-1">v4163</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6821
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz wir danne beſchowen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4164" id="v4164" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4164" tabindex="-1">v4164</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6822
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an ende mit der vrowen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4165" id="v4165" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4165" tabindex="-1">v4165</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6823
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
