         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6824
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz herodeſ was betrogen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4167" id="v4167" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4167" tabindex="-1">v4167</a>
