         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6836
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do in chriſt kom zehanden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4178" id="v4178" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4178" tabindex="-1">v4178</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6837
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
