         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6840
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des het er ſich nach ertobt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4181" id="v4181" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4181" tabindex="-1">v4181</a>
