         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6855
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſinen zorn rechen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4186" id="v4186" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4186" tabindex="-1">v4186</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6856
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des eilte er ſich beſprechen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4187" id="v4187" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4187" tabindex="-1">v4187</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6857
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit argiſten <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4188" id="v4188" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4188" tabindex="-1">v4188</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6858
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die deſ keine friſten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4189" id="v4189" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4189" tabindex="-1">v4189</a>
