         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in ſelben zeſchanden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4282" id="v4282" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4282" tabindex="-1">v4282</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7001
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
