         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7006
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>reht alſam ze den schaffen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4285" id="v4285" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4285" tabindex="-1">v4285</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7007
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die wolfe zv<span>o</span> ſpringent<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4286" id="v4286" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4286" tabindex="-1">v4286</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7008
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vnz ſi ſei nid bringent<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4287" id="v4287" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4287" tabindex="-1">v4287</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7009
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>alſo tobten diebe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4288" id="v4288" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4288" tabindex="-1">v4288</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7010
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir herren zeliebe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="" id="" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#" tabindex="-1"></a>
