         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7042
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da ſlu<span>o</span>gen ſi die menige<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4295" id="v4295" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4295" tabindex="-1">v4295</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7043
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>beide arm v reiche <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4296" id="v4296" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4296" tabindex="-1">v4296</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7044
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>alle geliche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4297" id="v4297" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4297" tabindex="-1">v4297</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7045
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſi gedahten an des kunige<span class="del">s</span> wort<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4298" id="v4298" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4298" tabindex="-1">v4298</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7046
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit fleizze ſtiften ſi daz mort<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4299" id="v4299" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4299" tabindex="-1">v4299</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7047
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſi zukten ſei ze fluſte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4300" id="v4300" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4300" tabindex="-1">v4300</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7048
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den mu<span>e</span>tren ab der bruſte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4301" id="v4301" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4301" tabindex="-1">v4301</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7049
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
