         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7053
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von in ran milich fur daz plu<span>o</span>t <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4306" id="v4306" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4306" tabindex="-1">v4306</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7054
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz gab in grimmigen mu<span>o</span>t<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4307" id="v4307" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4307" tabindex="-1">v4307</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7055
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſwie ſo daz ſpunne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4308" id="v4308" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4308" tabindex="-1">v4308</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7056
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von den bruſten runne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4309" id="v4309" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4309" tabindex="-1">v4309</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7057
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>doch kunden die zagen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4310" id="v4310" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4310" tabindex="-1">v4310</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7058
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir wu<span>e</span>tens niht ver haben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4311" id="v4311" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4311" tabindex="-1">v4311</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7059
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vnz ſi gar lagen tot<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4312" id="v4312" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4312" tabindex="-1">v4312</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7060
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
