         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die mueter die daz ſahen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4314" id="v4314" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4314" tabindex="-1">v4314</a>
