         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7062
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſi begunden ſich roufen v ſlahen <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4315" id="v4315" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4315" tabindex="-1">v4315</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7063
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>deſ ſint ſi nv geſellen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4316" id="v4316" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4316" tabindex="-1">v4316</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7064
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des tiefels in der hellen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4317" id="v4317" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4317" tabindex="-1">v4317</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7065
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Do div ſlaht gefrumet was<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4318" id="v4318" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4318" tabindex="-1">v4318</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7066
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>v der kinde denhaineſ genas<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4319" id="v4319" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4319" tabindex="-1">v4319</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7067
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in allem dem chraizze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4320" id="v4320" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4320" tabindex="-1">v4320</a>
