         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7634
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſi kan vns wol weiſen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4752" id="v4752" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4752" tabindex="-1">v4752</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7635
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>v helfen ovz den fraiſen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4753" id="v4753" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4753" tabindex="-1">v4753</a>
